#showas:Zenith 之友
This scenario is a great introduction to the new Zenith factions. 

Both the Dark Zenith Svikari and the Zenith Architrave are allied to the player. The Svikari need help to expand while the Architrave is self-sufficient.

The AI is a random "easier" AI type at difficulty 5. 

There are a couple of nomad planets roaming the galaxy. These will connect to nearby planets and disconnect when too far away. 